      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKEVIEW IAN (8) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing eighth (43.32) in a Group Listed at The Meadows. Should be very hard to beat this time. HECTOR DARCY (1) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Finished third (34.74) at The Meadows latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Can feature again. DR. FANATICAL (5) racing well without winning, placing at his last four runs. Last time finished 3rd in a Grade 4/5 on September 20 over 510m at Sale behind Lakeview Sneaky beaten 0.8 lengths (28.92). Well placed and gets his chance. TRENDY TOMMY (7) has top-three aspirations after placing last time.",
